              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngubani owaziyo ukuthi uyakuba-hlakaniphile noma isiwula na? nokho uyakubusa phezu kwawo wonke umshikashika wami engiwushikashikashikayo nengihlakaniphe ngawo phansi kwelanga. Nalokhu kuyize.",
